          "urpx:evaluationKind": {
            "@id": "urpx:coverageEvaluation"
          },
          "urpx:description": "Part H's HPWH quantities are carried for every Baseline Region, allocation and season. They are kWh per day, as are the bounds they adjust, and this document does not state how a consumer scales either to a billing period, which Part H paragraph 3 does by the number of summer and winter days in it. The adjusting brackets name the tier @ids of sce:tou-d-5-8pm-2026-10-01, so a later version of the schedule needs its own version of this modifier.",
